      "message": "Hi,\nThank you for bringing this up. I am also puzzled by this, as I have reviewed many vendor hook patches and official documentation, but I haven\u0027t found a clear pattern. I\u0027m not sure if I should place it in include/trace/hooks/**.h or if I need to create a new *.h file. I thought pm_domain.h was the closest match to the problem I\u0027m addressing, so I added it there. How can I determine which .h file to use? If there are any guidelines or rules, please let me know. I will greatly appreciate your assistance.",
